module tasks.`2026-11-22-kb-index-external-adds`

task KbIndexExternalAdds {
  title "KB index misses records added by git pull while running"
  verify $ cargo nextest run -p bboxy450-term-mux -E 'test(index) | test(knowledge)'
  paths "crates/bbt-mux", "crates/bboxy450-term-data_source-bboxy", "verification", "Cargo.lock"
  brief """
    Our stand: subtract before you add; report what you removed. ROLE: EXECUTOR.

    ## Gap (Oracle, observed 2026-11-22)
    After `git pull --rebase` fast-forwarded the shared KB checkout by 59 commits, records that arrived that way are on disk but not in the knowledge index: `knowledge_fetch specs/python-charts` and `specs/svg-renderer` return `not_found` (files present, `den.check` sound, `managed {}` blocks present), while `specs/canvas` (modified, previously indexed) resolves. `knowledge_status` reports root revision 0, 28985 records.

    ## Do
    Find why externally added files (git pull, checkout) are not indexed while running: watcher scope, create vs modify events, a startup-only scan, or a refusal. Make externally added and removed records reach the index without an app restart, with a process witness that adds a record through `git` while the host runs and fetches it. Name what you removed.

    ## Second gap: canvas home doubles `.bboxy` (Oracle, observed)
    `crates/bbt-mux/src/mcp/canvas.rs:262-267` picks `root/.bboxy/canvases` whenever `root/.bboxy` is a directory. The knowledge root is already `.bboxy`, and a stray nested `.bboxy/.bboxy/` tree was committed in `2b1f9c388` (Nov 4: `.bboxy/.bboxy/tasks/2026-11-03-codex-launch-parity.md`, which differs from the canonical `.bboxy/tasks/` copy). So canvases are stored at `.bboxy/.bboxy/canvases/` (canvas-152779724248273, committed by the Oracle in 52f255a42).
    Do: one home for canvases derived from the knowledge root, without the guess; move existing canvas records there on startup (or say why not); report the differing nested task copy to the Oracle in your report instead of deleting it (the Oracle disposes of KB records).

    ## Attempt 2 (Oracle, 2026-11-22)
    Attempt 1's Codex seat exited mid-task (turn ended `agent.cancelled`, process gone before the auto-continue deadline; seat 01M82YG6… stuck in closed_grace). Its work is commit `9b6fd2ab5` "Reconcile live KB records and use the canonical canvas store", checked out in your worktree `~/mydev/bbx-kb-index` (branch `kb-index-2`; unmanaged because the stuck seat still binds the managed record). Work only there. Review it against this brief, finish what is missing, verify and land. Its session log is `~/.bboxy450-harness/sessions/01M82YGBZS5SH367NMA23V2AR3.jsonl` if you need its reasoning.

    ## Land
    Long commands detached. `make land`. Report at reports/2026-11-22-kb-index-external-adds.den, then `task_report`.
    """

  managed {
    allowed_paths = json"[\"crates/bbt-mux\",\"crates/bboxy450-term-data_source-bboxy\",\"verification\",\"Cargo.lock\",\"crates/bboxy450-canvas\"]"
    assignee = json"\"seat:01M83BNHQMSS2XY3PPDB4WJK4F\""
    authorship = json"{\"kind\":\"seat\",\"process_generation\":\"1\",\"public_key\":\"+Z+SffD6ma7+9tH7HcO8nu+L88bfZ9A4Xu1v6WL7C48=\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M8288EHSV7SQ289RE0J1SK0S\"}"
    created = json"\"2026-11-22T18:40:45.262Z\""
    created_by = json"\"seat:01M8288EHSV7SQ289RE0J1SK0S\""
    delegated_by = json"\"seat:01M8288EHSV7SQ289RE0J1SK0S\""
    id = json"\"01M828YTHGX82AKMA49DBF11C7\""
    number = json"1794292861627760"
    role = json"\"executor\""
    status = Claimed
    swarm = json"\"01M7P04CW1T6KY8CMSS6DQM12Q\""
    updated = json"\"2026-11-23T04:47:20.714Z\""
    updated_by = json"\"seat:01M8288EHSV7SQ289RE0J1SK0S\""
    provenance = json"{\"digest\":\"sha256:2d7764895ba1c00ea3e4eb9135fefd89a6c677797b434ce8d9999b20b1371aff\",\"frontmatter_digest\":\"sha256:6bacb1357b7dc075e43e29cff5a4dc097aa4cd4178b0a4607ff34d74450a6129\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M8288EHSV7SQ289RE0J1SK0S\",\"sig\":\"vs29JhjSwjzATux3bLwza+K2G86ngf7PiW6GwfpcZm+92OHEzwmdwi84C1ogUB97crtjy/4b1xKUg5SWCSxQBw==\",\"log\":\"bboxy://activity/index-93ad8c65834c983167272adcebd708d5016d7d1135673e1090720e78289f698a/1198\",\"event\":{\"id\":\"01M83BNRQR434YVB6PBY29PDED\",\"sequence\":1198,\"hash\":\"dbd567365c17e30f150d5630aaecee059980cb47c86ea70066fb7c0064046a43\"}}"
